OL,3,GNEWSAWoman home after breaking both
OL,4,Alegs at flower show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who broke both of her legs
OL,7,Fafter falling at a flower show was
OL,8,Famong the first patients discharged
OL,9,Fafter being treated at the National
OL,10,FRehabilitation Centre (NRC).
OL,12,FLiz Mant, who suffers from weakened
OL,13,Fbones due to treatment for a bowel
OL,14,Fdisease, collapsed in the heat at
OL,15,FRutland Flower Show in August.
OL,17,FShe spent four weeks undergoing
OL,18,Foperations at the Queen's Medical
OL,19,FCentre in Nottingham and was
OL,20,Ftransferred to the rehabilitation
OL,21,Fcentre on 9 September, a week after it
OL,22,Fopened.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
